<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!-- v0.6.0: items mirror PreferenceBundles/WXKeyboardToolbarPlus.bundle/Root.plist.
         The two files must always list the same keys, otherwise the panel
         either fails to render or shows blank rows. -->
    <key>entry</key>
    <dict>
        <key>bundle</key>
        <string>WXKeyboardToolbarPlus</string>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSLinkCell</string>
        <key>detail</key>
        <string>PSListItemsController</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>微信键盘工具栏增强</string>
    </dict>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
        <string>enabledGroup</string>
        <string>enabledSwitch</string>
        <string>infoGroup</string>
        <string>diagGroup</string>
        <string>verboseScan</string>
        <string>pathGroup</string>
        <string>resetGroup</string>
        <string>tipGroup</string>
    </array>

    <key>enabledGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>主开关</string>
    </dict>
    <key>enabledSwitch</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <true/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.gusing.wxkbtoolbarplus</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>Enabled</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>启用插件</string>
    </dict>

    <key>infoGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>当前为诊断版本（0.6.0）。插件不替换任何方法、不操作任何视图，也不会注入键盘扩展进程，只读取并上报信息。</string>
    </dict>

    <key>diagGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>诊断</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>插件启动后会在微信输入法 App 沙盒的 Documents 目录写入 wxkbt-status.txt。用 Filza 进入应用容器查看即可。</string>
    </dict>
    <key>verboseScan</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <false/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.gusing.wxkbtoolbarplus</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>VerboseScan</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>深度扫描（仅排查用）</string>
    </dict>

    <key>pathGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>状态文件位置</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>微信输入法 App 沙盒的 Documents/wxkbt-status.txt</string>
    </dict>

    <key>resetGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>生效方式</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>改完设置后请完全退出微信输入法（从多任务里划掉）再重新打开。</string>
    </dict>

    <key>tipGroup</key>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>键盘扩展与宿主 App 是两个独立进程，类表不同。本插件只注入宿主 App，键盘进程完全不受影响。</string>
    </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
